+# VeilEngine
+
+VeilEngine is the Veil-maintained fork of TrustTunnel Client. It keeps the upstream TrustTunnel protocol implementation and adds the runtime behavior Veil needs, including process-aware split tunneling on Windows.
+
+Veil downloads prebuilt VeilEngine runtime assets from this repository. Use the upstream TrustTunnelClient releases only if you do not need Veil's application-based split tunneling features.
+
